From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:58:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): tool kind glyphs on the Tool library catalog rows
 and the tool picker

Each Tool library catalog row and each operation page tool picker item
now wears its kind's existing tool-* glyph at 16 px, before the unchanged
label. The picker keeps its selected-tool glyph beside the combo.

Refs #661

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
